    "_summary": "The classic arcade game made 100% with PlayMaker.",
    "_description": "# Invaders\n\nA retro alien-invasion shooter inspired by the classic arcade game Space Invaders.\n\n{height=300}![screenshot](Packages/com.hutonggames.playmaker/Editor/Addons/Packages/com.hutonggames.playmaker.samples.invaders.jpg)\n\n## Features\n\nThe sample shows how to:\n\n\n- Build a wave of enemies using prefabs.\n- Use input to control a player spaceship.\n- Spawn bullets and detect collisions.\n- Periodically select a random invader to shoot back.\n- Set difficulty progression using a DataTable.\n- Save/load high scores using a DataTable.\n- Track player lives and score.\n- End game when out of lives.\n",
